<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.25</p>
<p>higher than Wednesday's close. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    57.75-58.25</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    56.25-57.25</p>
<p>US 3-4	290-310 lbs    54.25-55.25</p>
<p>Sows:  1.50-2.00 lower. Top 47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-700 lbs    47.00</p>
</text>
